      "created_at": "2020-01-22T15:38:32Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-01-22T15:48:29Z",
      "body": "Hey to reproduce you need to cross-pollenate your cookies a bit.\r\n\r\n1. Clear your cookies\r\n2. Visit https://www.bbc.com/pidgin\r\n3. Visit a PAL page without accepting the cookies policy (i.e. https://www.bbc.com/pidgin/tori-51194083).\r\n4. Still don't accept the cookies policy. Visit https://www.bbc.com/pidgin again.\r\n5. You will now see the cookies banner repeatedly, even after accepting, while navigating through Simorgh pages.\r\n6. If interested, you will now see the duplication of the cookies with different domains within your dev tools. One accepted, and one not.\r\n![duplicate cookies](https://i.imgur.com/L8gvLrI.png)",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
